sc/qF5S6Fq1cR-AoFmVO0uE26lBOHKEAnPSp_0NQtkbfkPGvJv2GJXy5AWWYMBWQ156PcEOWWBqdm28KAF0fmyaQec2Etzypxve7-PYtzDD35waVYdZR3dV6P9j6MqOYhlG2uQnCoIR_hNH-86vCdrJDag0Dvz_hPCO5rXJ6tkGNuEpzXy12_sfJy__5N1xnNOc3pFySYwlsp1xNGJZfmGvUvgnwEpaX3INYiK-qUT24U01p83CSf5wbipdDQerOTLjIWIqRVgL8-HqpcR4kOpEjcPu0ic_lIWVu3NB2PhSWfmuI8VD-DsC65q00AnYzye640qVbj03QKJrOHUkS7LhBdNojGef6R9BpnVOU0s5MyadMA9WrKcCpjAPJn9Kii7wywjMg1nocefN27MoYzQ9-uo-vetncQF0SdkARfeEEES6NhQimJPgFGjCx4WfW7cLNyHCfI3kVxhZAs_pX89Z3EeuCYzM6kNQj-uh7NX0vJ6knm-A3YT1Sc1tEK22vrmkgA5qeq85LpgiPo8FE5I5/apmzy_uaiEEowXHgLa0ghTbhr7jk8sTU/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="人工智能迎来软件漏洞快速爆发的时代"&gt;，本周，世界各地的银行、航空公司和政府出于预防目的关闭了其网站，&lt;/a&gt;以防止其遭到黑客攻击。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;人工智能模型越来越能够发现严重的网络安全漏洞，从而增强黑客利用漏洞的能力。这为网络安全迈出了惊人的新步伐，将组织应对人工智能发现的威胁的时间缩短到接近于零。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/q1nLGaiGutF6C8xIV7jtlsAuFhVOzS6sWLlGCgklKNYl469RI6e_4MVivkD60hBfRMsS360Y7BQOJg24axaUSfVgIzePkWEaw_DzMW0kBxR4tn9oHhecV2H9p_d8ySTX2F7WRtfmTi7_fJOr2-Cyic5l4zJbo-p1EHBQ-sI6TWk1hJWHjHZVLvIU_iPTFlgqlXcUPfkr9fU6nymX4wgFXLyTKwmzQqAGDBMQQek8pDzlRB8juSLz2KOUUKHfglb06jbrPbN-M_DyvbiCzsqoiAF_SKUpk0rOOoD42A98h-1vzJWIjSJK7Ky4uvCQUU3JDhQXGOb_UTRyPfpJXBcNzHCYP2r-OVvwf4SbptBTBO-K7lkCowBVXMmwi3yBfgobfUkiBo82a036dflgoHHh6Tt3eJV3MkN7GSdEp0NaOZr7SmAMRbURHgJXn-9ehT7q7BibFhKpNYzp0W31filYIdQNljdPaTXKZBcBtdGRIuKI3HCGveg7RrIn7TnbyhmU0WXaMi3ACLIDRwBBDdKCvU_61jt8iMB5/5jXTkUDc8dg26RU_kpaQtaqzofZzgBJL/25" style="font-size: inherit; color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 0 0 24px 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iLWU5w8wESwE/v0/-1x-1.jpg" alt=" " width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;i